  "worked_solution": "Starting with the first term ${a}_{1}=-4,$ we compute the next terms using the recursive formula until we reach the third term.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & =-4 \\\\ {a}_{2} & =3{a}_{1}-1=3\\cdot (-4)-1=-13 \\\\ {a}_{3} & =3{a}_{2}-1=3\\cdot (-13)-1=-40\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the third term is ${a}_{3}=-40.$",
